THE CHANGES THAT HAVE BEEN MADE:

Kernel/ proc.c and proc.h both were changed by adding int priority and int num_epoch_slots.
They were also given default values of 10 and 0. Custom system calls sys_debug were made. 
Priority fork was created. Registered sys_debug and sys_priorty_fork. 

